Constant BASE_DIR:
- anchor local file roots to the backend repo

Class Settings:
- load .env and process environment variables
- expose app, database, S3, auth, model-routing, benchmark-local-root, and provider API config
- keep secrets as SecretStr
- provide is_local helper for reload behavior
- expose all_models_list so local evaluation can read one comma-separated model matrix from .env
- treat `PRIMARY_REASONING_MODEL`, `FAST_REASONING_MODEL`, and `CALIBRATION_MODEL` as combined `provider:model_name` refs
- allow `SLUG_SELECTOR_MODEL` to be either a bare model name or one combined `provider:model_name` reference while still falling back to the fast-reasoning model ref

Function _split_model_ref:
- split one optional combined model reference into provider and model name
- accept `provider:model_name` when present or else reuse the configured fallback provider with the raw model name
- fall back entirely when the setting is blank

Function get_settings:
- cache one Settings instance per process
